OL,5,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FDuring a busy shift in Resus, a
OL,7,     F58-year-old woman arrives by
OL,8,     Fambulance with a dangerously fast
OL,9,     Fheart rate, and a patient comes in
OL,10,     Ffollowing a suspected drug
OL,11,     Foverdose.
OL,12,G2100 A&E After Dark
OL,13,     FA man is rushed in to Majors
OL,14,     Fsuffering a collapsed lung as air
OL,15,     Fleaks into his chest cavity, a
OL,16,     Fhighly abusive patient must be
OL,17,     Frestrained, and a rough sleeper
OL,18,     Fcomes in with burnt feet.
